    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017030170,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201703/2002017030170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これ、『170度に予め熱したオーブンで』って\r\n書いてある…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017030180,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ああ……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201703/2002017030180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017030190,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ふふ、よくありますよね\r\nそういう書き方をしているレシピ本",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201703/2002017030190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え……\r\n大丈夫なのか、これ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017030200,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "大丈夫ですよ\r\nだから謝る必要もないです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201703/2002017030200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017030210,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "オーブンの予熱って、結構すぐできるんですよ\r\n使ったものを片付けていればすぐです",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201703/2002017030210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017030220,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "『一晩おく』とかじゃなければ、全然問題ないです",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201703/2002017030220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "な、なんか……めちゃくちゃ実感こもってるな……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017030230,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "昔やらかしたことがありまして……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201703/2002017030230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど……",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "さすがだなぁ！",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "よくあるのか？",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "罠だな、これ",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017030240,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そんな、褒めてもらえるようなものじゃないですよ\r\n慣れです",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201703/2002017030240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017030250,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "料理を始めた頃は、そういう裏でやっておくこととか、\r\n別に必要なものとか、全然対応できなくて",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201703/2002017030250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017030260,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "にっちもさっちも行かなくなって、\r\n帰ってきた母がぎょっとする……なんてこともあって",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201703/2002017030260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは\r\n想像できるかもしれない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017030270,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そうですか？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201703/2002017030270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017030280,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "結局母がどうにかしてくれて……って感じでしたね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201703/2002017030280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織、頑張ったんだなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017030290,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……そんなにしみじみ言われると照れるのですが",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_cheat",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201703/2002017030290"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017030300,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "でも、母もよくやらせ続けてくれたなとは思います",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201703/2002017030300"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017030310,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "まぁ、それだけ仕事が忙しかったというのも\r\nあるかもしれないんですけど……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201703/2002017030310"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "こういう……\r\n後出し的なさ……！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017030320,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あるあるです",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201703/2002017030320"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017030330,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "私も、最初の頃はよく引っかかってました",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201703/2002017030330"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017030340,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そもそも分量外がなんのことかわからなかったり、\r\n一晩おくと出てきてパニックになったり",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201703/2002017030340"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017030350,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "それこそ、オーブンの予熱も",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201703/2002017030350"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織にもそんな時期があったんだなぁ、\r\n今じゃこんなにできるのに",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017030360,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "まぁ……慣れですよね\r\nやっぱり続けることは意味があるなと思います",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201703/2002017030360"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そのおかげで、今日のおやつが確保できる、と\r\n大きく書いておかないとな！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『灯織が作りました！』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002017030370,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ええ……恥ずかしいので嫌ですよ……？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
